---

import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
import Container from '../ui/Container.astro';
---

<section class="relative py-10 sm:py-16" id="cta">
  <Container>
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-surface px-8 py-16 text-center sm:px-16 sm:py-24">
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-125 w-175 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 radial-glow blur-3xl"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
      </div>
      <div class="grid-bg pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-30 mask-[radial-gradient(ellipse_70%_70%_at_50%_50%,black,transparent)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
          Ready to Take the Next Step?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-balance text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted sm:text-lg">
          Whether you are looking to strengthen your brand, attract the right audience, or establish a stronger digital presence, Grovera is here to support your journey with thoughtful marketing rooted in Islamic values.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-balance text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
          If you are looking for a marketing partner that values trust, clarity, and doing things the right way, we would love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
          <Button href="mailto:hello@grovera.com" variant="primary">Get in Touch</Button>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Let us build your business the right way.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
